    "media:imagetext": "EFFECTIVE\nFEBRUARY 1, 1985\nPIEDMONT\nAIRLINES\nQUICK REFERENCE SCHEDULE\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nSAN JOSE\nFor Reservations and information in San Francisco\nArea Code 415, call 978-9663; in Oakland and San Jose,\ncall 800-251-5720.\nFor Air Cargo, in San Francisco, call\n415-876-7204; in Oakland, call 415-839-2423;\nin San Jose, call 408-298-0699.\nFly via our Charlotte and\nDayton hubs for super\nservice to many great\nPiedmont destinations.\nMealLy Ap Ar Ap Flight No. Freg. Stops MealLy Ap Ar Ap Flight No. Fred, Stops\nTo Akron/Canton, Oh\nFrom Akron\nCanton\nD 210pS 1036p 8/29\nDAY B 700a 1005aS 32/5\n376-4358\n453-1454\nDAY\nTo Asheville, NC\nL 1215p S\n1002p 6/42\nFrom Asheville\nCLT B 700a\n1125a S 49/7\n254-4621\nCLT\nTo Athens, Ga\nL 1215p S\n930p 6/ED909 X6 CLT B 720a\nFrom Athens Sunbird\n1125a S ED900/7\n800-438-7833\nX67\nCLT\nTo Atlanta, Ga\nContact Piedmont Airlines\nFrom Atlanta\nB 730a 1125aS 766/7\n7\n681-3100\nCLT\nTo Augusta, Ga\nL 1215p S\n906p\n6/269\nFrom Augusta\nCL 750a\n1125a S 214/7\n722-7875\nCLT\nTo Baltimore, Md\nL 1215p S 1119p 6/290\nFrom Baltimore\n761-5402\nCLT\nContact Piedmont Airlines\nTo Champaign/Urbana, IL\nFrom Champaign\nUrbana\nD 210pS 944p 8/437\nDAY B 600a\n1005a S 456/5\n359-3601\n359-3601\nDAY\nTo Charleston, SC\nL 1215p S\n904p\n6/275\nFrom Charleston\nCLT B 750a\n1125aS 242/7\n723-6107\nCLT",
